        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it does. Unless otherwise specified, cards don't lose effects when suspended.",
        "question": "Does this card's [Start of Your Turn] effect activate if it's suspended?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, [BT3-040 Shakkoumon]'s effect allows it to be played as a Blue Digimon.",
        "question": "If I play [BT3-040 Shakkoumon], does this card's effect activate?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      }
    ]
